[C,README.md,54] ### Features
[C,README.md,55] 
[C,README.md,56] * Parses and unparses SRI strings.
[C,README.md,57] * Generates SRI strings from direct data or Streams.
[C,README.md,58] * Optional use of reserved `option-expression` syntax.
[C,README.md,59] * Multiple entries for the same algorithm.
[C,README.md,60] * Object-based integrity string manipulation.
[A,README.md,61] * Optional strict parsing that follows the spec as closely as possible.
